      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.15840148925781,
        684.905029296875,
        107.04540252685547,
        696.0655517578125
      ],
      "text": ":",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        697.2396850585938,
        503.5994873046875,
        708.4002075195312
      ],
      "text": "1.\tThe reviewed evidence and recommendations apply to the use of AlereLAM only, because other in-house LAM-based",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.5886001586914,
        706.7396850585938,
        520.6348876953125,
        717.9002075195312
      ],
      "text": "assays have not been adequately validated or used outside limited research settings. Any new or generic LAM-based assay",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.5886001586914,
        716.2396850585938,
        341.1683654785156,
        727.4002075195312
      ],
      "text": "should be subject to adequate validation in the settings of intended use.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        725.7396850585938,
        511.3514709472656,
        736.9002075195312
      ],
      "text": "2.\tAll patients with signs and symptoms of pulmonary TB who are capable of producing sputum should submit at least one",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.5886001586914,
        735.2396850585938,
        518.7528076171875,
        746.4002075195312
      ],
      "text": "sputum specimen for Xpert MTB/RIF (Ultra) assay, as their initial diagnostic test. This also includes children and adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.5886001586914,
        744.7396850585938,
        288.2940673828125,
        755.9002075195312
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV who are able to provide a sputum sample.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        754.2396850585938,
        498.1526184082031,
        765.4002075195312
      ],
      "text": "3.\tThese recommendations also apply to adolescents and children living with HIV, based on generalization of data from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.5886001586914,
        763.7396850585938,
        400.2297668457031,
        774.9002075195312
      ],
      "text": "adults, while acknowledging that there are very limited data for these population groups.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        773.2396850585938,
        503.43194580078125,
        784.4002075195312
      ],
      "text": "4.\tLF-LAM should be used as an add-on to clinical judgement in combination with other tests; it should not be used as a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.5886001586914,
        782.7396850585938,
        177.0469207763672,
        793.9002075195312
      ],
      "text": "replacement or triage test.",
